abstract: "Frictionless expense tracking: iPhone Shortcuts send expenses to GitHub Actions, which record them in a Supabase ledger with deterministic labeling, vision-based receipt reading, budgets with flexible periods and a nightly AI audit routine. Configurable per user through a setup interview."
